# A99 (kernel desktop, sd-base, no #Z): A68-A70's gesture -- idle dump, hover the
# Desk title (22,8), click "Desktop info..." (60,28) -> the form_alert (FL3DACT
# OK button at ~(291..347, 264..290)); then press the OK button and HOLD it
# (form_do -> graf_watchbox -> ob_change(SELECTED): FL3DACT = full redraw, sunk
# bevel), dump while held with the pointer on the button's lower-right corner
# (it must stay inside the button or graf_watchbox releases it), release ->
# the alert closes, park, dump.
1100 mark A_IDLE
1200 park
1206 move 300 300
1400 move 22 8
1800 mark B_DESK_MENU
2000 move 60 28
2200 down
2206 up
2800 mark C_ABOUT_ALERT
3000 move 340 285
3400 down
3900 mark D_OK_HELD
4200 up
4600 parkbr
5200 mark E_AFTER_RELEASE
